{"title":"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be a positive integer. If the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b3064ac37557e7bae7943f12c8f5f9c30e7dec02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+2y+z=n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" /> has 28 solutions in positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must be either \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce6bb48ffed260de7c1f02953e8f2e848f928ffe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 14 \\text{ or } 15\\ \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 15 \\text{ or } 16\\ \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 16 \\text{ or } 17\\ \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 17 \\text{ or } 18\\ \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 18 \\text{ or } 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"497\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This is equivalent to finding the powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> with coefficient <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a18ed2b9dfa5bdef83a2dc8cef407c4912178aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k^2+k^4+k^6+k^8+...)^2(k+k^2+k^3+k^4+...)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"374\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>But this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/4/fe475815145297489654089797448e1e260c4a9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{k^2}{1-k^2}\\right)^2\\cdot\\frac{k}{1-k}\\ =\\ k^5\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{1-k}\\right)^3\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{1+k}\\right)^2\\ =\\ k^5\\cdot(1+k)\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{1-k^2}\\right)^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"601\" height=\"47\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0f44a5c8dbcf2d784ef15750d11189726318062.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=k^5(1+k)(\\tbinom{2}{2}+\\tbinom{3}{2}k^2+\\tbinom{4}{2}k^4+\\tbinom{5}{2}k^6+...)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"356\" height=\"24\" />, the last part having general term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/e/3ae9762d732d966b535d7cafb36e0996c44a5681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tbinom{j}{2}k^{2j-4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"62\" height=\"22\" />\nfrom which it is easy to see that, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/c/28c31a2c05b0d490b42d4ed5cf0d9c62031ff1bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tbinom{8}{2}=28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"64\" height=\"22\" />, the last part contains the term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d0c33d29614f63a95f65aba24ad2c878707991a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28k^{12}$\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" /> and the whole result <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/8/2c83cace61e5ef86cf4e6b9819dab6382e169188.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28k^{17}+28k^{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfbf4df7c25681bb178ddc50ee0c0d656aa25b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is even. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is even, so let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/5/d450910bbcaf640d2b5b96f212952c28f2fc7fb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=2t$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/7/c37a409ab0661cc29e0f97bf3d7eef86d04ea993.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+t=\\frac{n}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"34\" />. By stars and bars, this has\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c826e4ba1c80baa09ac2f4cea862e1dd9b2decd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\binom{\\frac{n}{2}-1}{3-1}\\]\" width=\"63\" height=\"53\" />\nsolutions. This implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/b/30b958ce67fa30a916124de68b12882a7e150075.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{2}-1=8\\to n=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"163\" height=\"34\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is odd, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f19d6d0f3677c7e249160b6d6294ec81d6950bfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=2t-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/0/6c02173adcd72ecb84fbf752a973c9944f343739.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+t=\\frac{n+1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"143\" height=\"38\" />, in which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30e5a50f89eb87941facbb1e7b1ae91777fa10f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=17$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> is a solution. The answer is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfbf4df7c25681bb178ddc50ee0c0d656aa25b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~yofro\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME\" title=\"1989 AHSME\">1989 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"